OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry and
OL,6,Fclear night ahead. Temperatures will
OL,7,Ffall sharply overnight beneath long
OL,8,Fclear spells as winds ease. A
OL,9,Fwidespread frost is expected, most
OL,10,Fsevere inland and on the moors.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FA cold start, but dry and
OL,13,Fsunny throughout the day. Another
OL,14,Fchilly day, with temperatures a few
OL,15,Fdegrees below average for the time of
OL,16,Fyear, but with calm winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
