OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fbut dry on Saturday, then a mix of
OL,7,Fbright spells and showers throughout
OL,8,FSunday, and a brisk breeze. Remaining
OL,9,Fcloudy on Monday, though with fewer
OL,10,Fshowers.
